WEBVTT

00:13:27.658 --> 00:13:30.516
and eats the bran flakes for breakfast.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.446
AG: In the moment,
the want self is often stronger.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.531
No matter how hard
you try to push yourself

00:13:35.555 --> 00:13:37.262
to do the work you should be doing,

00:13:37.286 --> 00:13:40.346
it's easy to get pulled into the show
you want to be binging.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:42.283
Like, maybe, "The Handmaid's Tale"?

00:13:42.307 --> 00:13:43.666
(Music)

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.306
That's the bad news.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:48.316
The good news is that the should
self is smarter.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.676
You can outwit the want self
by planning ahead.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.356
This is a second strategy
for beating procrastination

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.236
that science teaches us.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.936
You don't have to worry
about resisting temptation

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.116
if you remove temptation.